# Accessibility Rules

- Interactive elements must be keyboard accessible.
- Icon-only buttons must have accessible labels.
- Form fields must have labels or aria-label.
- Disabled actions should explain why when possible.
- Tables must use semantic table structure unless there is a reason not to.
- Loading and error states should be announced when appropriate.
- Do not remove focus outlines without replacing them with visible focus styles.